<title>USA: Capstead named to PaineWebber's focus list.</title>
<headline>Capstead named to PaineWebber's focus list.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The retail division of PaineWebber Inc Inc on Wednesday said that it added Capstead Mortgage Corp to its focus list.</p>
<p>The list is a portfolio of no more than 30 stocks chosen for their performance potential, PaineWebber said in a statement.</p>
<p>Capstead, based in Dallas, is a mortgage investor, structured as a real estate investment trust, specializing in insured home mortgage loans.</p>
<p>PaineWebber forecast Capstead earnings at $2.35 per share for 1997 and $2.55 per share for 1998.</p>
</text>
